Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 10:45:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Map connected controllers to players with USCL_AUTO_PADS

SDL3 port of uscl-eden 0012: with USCL_AUTO_PADS set, every connected game
controller becomes players 1-8 in connection order, mapped with Eglantine's
own per-controller defaults (Joy-Con pairs as one, motion). Wheels and flight
sticks are skipped; with no controller the settings are left alone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/input_common/drivers/sdl_driver.cpp | 32 +++++++++++++++++
 src/input_common/drivers/sdl_driver.h   |  3 ++
 src/input_common/main.cpp               | 48 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 83 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/input_common/drivers/sdl_driver.cpp b/src/input_common/drivers/sdl_driver.cpp
